{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with up to 12 bots, or connect a controller to enable local multiplayer with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/e434ad236323ddcf4290d7ecf716b406.avif?t=1762269002\" width=1560 height=633 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.poster.avif?t=1762269002\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.webm?t=1762269002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag - </strong>Fight for a single flag and return it to the capture zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Practice - </strong>Compete for the most target hits or play solo and hunt for a 5x hit combo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Pickup - </strong>Smash your opponent into pixels and rush to collect them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Point - </strong>Reach the control points and secure them for 25 points each. Progress is faster in Hard difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orb - </strong>Hit the orb into the goal for 10 points. The next goal line respawns on the opposite side of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss - </strong>Defeat the boss by depleting their health meter with multiple stomps. They can evade attacks using a special teleport ability.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.poster.avif?t=1762269002\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.webm?t=1762269002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Particle Scatter - </strong>Break into pixels to evade stomps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puck - </strong>Throw a puck to stun your opponent; press down to drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Time - </strong>Go half speed at any time, with no limits.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/5c85f550cf511348b7669f78fb3571ac.poster.avif?t=1762269002\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/5c85f550cf511348b7669f78fb3571ac.webm?t=1762269002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Side - </strong>The home map with a simple and straightforward layout. Half city, half countryside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle - </strong>A quiet castle on the river, designed for flag fortification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Day - </strong>Cozy city suburb featuring a hockey rink mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooftop - </strong>A busy street separates an expanding business district. Try playing in low gravity!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yacht - </strong>Ahoy! Battle on the deck of a moonlit yacht. Equip the scuba mask for a fast getaway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(TBA)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Player Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect a controller and add a second player to the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961650?t=1762269002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/e9ae2c61309f204ce940312c683014d699cc8a8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762269002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/126fc3aa04b411e9653fe8b15e86745f1ff0e0c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762269002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/126fc3aa04b411e9653fe8b15e86745f1ff0e0c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762269002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with up to 12 bots, or connect a controller to enable local multiplayer with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/e434ad236323ddcf4290d7ecf716b406.avif?t=1762269002\" width=1560 height=633 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" p